1
00:01:48,983 --> 00:01:50,610
You haven't changed.

2
00:01:52,403 --> 00:01:53,404
Neither have you.

3
00:01:54,447 --> 00:01:55,990
No, I've changed.

4
00:01:56,533 --> 00:01:59,160
You can see that, can't you?

5
00:01:59,828 --> 00:02:00,870
I got old,

6
00:02:01,871 --> 00:02:03,081
and so have you.

7
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:06,543
And yet, you look just as I remember.

8
00:02:08,044 --> 00:02:12,298
Must be bad if you're
reachin' out like this.

9
00:02:13,007 --> 00:02:16,177
Yeah... You could say that.

10
00:02:16,261 --> 00:02:17,345
Tell me.

11
00:02:18,304 --> 00:02:20,306
It’s about my daughter.

12
00:02:21,432 --> 00:02:24,978
Been keepin' company
with some shady types lately.

13
00:02:25,061 --> 00:02:27,272
Calls themselves Maelstrom.

14
00:02:27,355 --> 00:02:29,941
You're kiddin'. Them?

15
00:02:30,024 --> 00:02:34,571
That's not all. She's been
installin' cyberware on her own...

16
00:02:35,905 --> 00:02:37,532
Chrome-junkie cult nonsense.

17
00:02:37,615 --> 00:02:40,493
Tried to stop her,
but she won't listen! If I push hard...

18
00:02:41,536 --> 00:02:43,288
she runs off to them.

19
00:02:43,371 --> 00:02:47,584
Lately, her moods have been unstable,
and she's been actin' strange.

20
00:02:47,667 --> 00:02:51,588
I think it's the early signs
of cyberpsychosis.

21
00:02:51,671 --> 00:02:53,381
- Hmm...
- I'm sure of it!

22
00:02:55,633 --> 00:02:57,552
Last time, it was her entire jaw!

23
00:02:57,635 --> 00:03:00,430
If we don’t stop her now,
it’ll be too late...

24
00:03:06,728 --> 00:03:09,230
Whoa, hold on!
That's what you wanna pitch me?!

25
00:03:09,314 --> 00:03:10,648
No!

26
00:03:11,649 --> 00:03:14,402
You've got experience dealin' with gangs.

27
00:03:14,485 --> 00:03:17,155
She's not a gangster, she's your daughter!

28
00:03:17,238 --> 00:03:18,239
Besides...

29
00:03:19,157 --> 00:03:21,159
I'm not good at lecturin' kids...

30
00:03:21,242 --> 00:03:23,202
It's not just about her.

31
00:03:24,329 --> 00:03:26,164
Maelstrom's involved!

32
00:03:26,247 --> 00:03:28,249
'Course, you'll get paid.

33
00:03:28,333 --> 00:03:30,209
That's not the issue here.

34
00:03:30,293 --> 00:03:34,172
It is. That’s why I came to you as a pro,
not as someone askin' for a favor.

35
00:03:34,255 --> 00:03:36,633
How about 50k? Paid upfront.

36
00:03:36,716 --> 00:03:37,926
Come on...

37
00:03:38,885 --> 00:03:40,428
Not enough?

38
00:03:40,511 --> 00:03:42,680
Thought that was more
than the standard rate.

39
00:03:42,764 --> 00:03:43,973
It is.

40
00:03:44,682 --> 00:03:46,684
- It's more than enough.
- Then...

41
00:03:47,310 --> 00:03:49,354
No, I can't take this job.

42
00:03:50,897 --> 00:03:52,398
Not the way I am...

43
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:55,693
I knew it.

44
00:03:57,612 --> 00:03:58,821
What?

45
00:03:58,905 --> 00:04:00,073
Look at the photo.

46
00:04:01,908 --> 00:04:03,076
Talia.

47
00:04:03,660 --> 00:04:05,578
She's our daughter.

48
00:04:06,913 --> 00:04:09,123
My... daughter?

49
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:08,975
Now I see why
I found you caught yesterday.

50
00:05:10,101 --> 00:05:14,272
You after Maelstrom footage?
Into more hardcore stuff than I expected.

51
00:05:14,355 --> 00:05:17,150
It's not like I wanna! It's a job...

52
00:05:17,650 --> 00:05:19,360
A job, huh...

53
00:05:21,863 --> 00:05:23,197
Then we're the same.

54
00:05:24,032 --> 00:05:25,033
The same?

55
00:05:25,116 --> 00:05:26,284
Lend me a hand.

56
00:05:27,201 --> 00:05:29,704
You wanna film it, right? The vid.

57
00:05:33,458 --> 00:05:35,418
By the way, haven't told me your name.

58
00:05:36,419 --> 00:05:38,129
Meant to ask before.

59
00:05:39,756 --> 00:05:41,966
My name's Roman. You?

60
00:05:42,675 --> 00:05:43,676
What's it matter?

61
00:05:43,760 --> 00:05:45,636
Be easier to talk, won't it?

62
00:05:47,722 --> 00:05:48,723
D.

63
00:05:49,432 --> 00:05:51,225
D? That's all I get?

64
00:05:51,309 --> 00:05:52,727
That's all you get.

65
00:05:53,311 --> 00:05:54,353
Here we are.

66
00:06:37,939 --> 00:06:39,398
Helio! Heli--!

67
00:06:42,235 --> 00:06:43,611
Who the fuck...?!

68
00:06:47,865 --> 00:06:49,117
- A kid...
- Heads up!

69
00:06:58,918 --> 00:07:00,837
Ow! Ow!

70
00:07:05,383 --> 00:07:08,302
Fuck! Fuckin' runner...

71
00:07:19,605 --> 00:07:22,233
Hey. You Helio?

72
00:07:22,316 --> 00:07:24,026
- Who... the fuck...
- Helio, right?!

73
00:07:24,110 --> 00:07:26,446
Stop! Yes! I'm Helio!

74
00:07:26,529 --> 00:07:28,030
I have questions.

75
00:07:28,114 --> 00:07:30,450
If this is about the chip,
then you're wastin' your ti--

76
00:07:31,742 --> 00:07:34,662
Whatever you wanna know,
I'll spill. Anything...

77
00:07:34,745 --> 00:07:36,330
Start makin' sense.

78
00:07:36,414 --> 00:07:38,791
Ain't you after that Arasaka datashard?

79
00:07:39,459 --> 00:07:41,419
You hit a Snake Nation camp.

80
00:07:42,879 --> 00:07:44,338
"Wait!"

81
00:07:44,964 --> 00:07:47,258
He's tryna say "wait"...

82
00:07:50,970 --> 00:07:53,347
Seriously? Was so long ago...

83
00:07:53,431 --> 00:07:54,557
"So long ago?"

84
00:07:58,144 --> 00:07:59,937
Nothin' "so long ago" about it.

85
00:08:00,021 --> 00:08:01,647
Been chasin' this the whole damn time...

86
00:08:01,731 --> 00:08:03,065
Shit... I get it...

87
00:08:03,149 --> 00:08:05,359
If you get it, then start fuckin' talkin'!

88
00:08:09,655 --> 00:08:13,326
Didn't do it. Didn't take the job.

89
00:08:13,409 --> 00:08:16,120
Never went to the nomad camp.

90
00:08:18,956 --> 00:08:19,957
Is that the truth?

91
00:08:20,041 --> 00:08:22,752
It's the truth. You've gotta believe me.

92
00:08:23,836 --> 00:08:26,797
Why... Why'd you decide not to go?

93
00:08:28,257 --> 00:08:31,469
It wasn’t supposed to be a raid.

94
00:08:31,552 --> 00:08:34,472
Gig was simple. Find someone.

95
00:08:34,555 --> 00:08:36,724
Pay too good to be true.

96
00:08:36,807 --> 00:08:40,228
Everyone else jumped on the cash.

97
00:08:40,311 --> 00:08:42,563
But somethin' wasn't addin' up,
so I backed out.

98
00:08:43,314 --> 00:08:46,859
Then shit went sideways at the scene.
Ended in a shoot-out...

99
00:08:46,943 --> 00:08:49,362
- So someone hired you?
- Yeah.

100
00:08:50,321 --> 00:08:51,322
Who?

101
00:08:51,405 --> 00:08:52,865
I don't know.

102
00:08:52,949 --> 00:08:55,076
Client kept it anonymous.

103
00:08:55,159 --> 00:08:57,578
In hindsight, it must've been a corpo.

104
00:08:57,662 --> 00:08:58,663
Which corp?

105
00:08:58,746 --> 00:09:00,623
Arasaka if I really had to guess.

106
00:09:00,706 --> 00:09:02,375
What would 'Saka want with us?

107
00:09:02,458 --> 00:09:03,876
Hell if I know.

108
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:07,338
Just guessin' off the gig route
and how they ran the op.

109
00:09:07,421 --> 00:09:09,423
Good that I passed on it.

110
00:09:09,507 --> 00:09:12,510
Of all corps,
Arasaka’s the one I can’t stand.

111
00:09:12,593 --> 00:09:16,138
Earlier, you mentioned
somethin' about an Arasaka chip.

112
00:09:16,222 --> 00:09:17,390
Is that related?

113
00:09:17,473 --> 00:09:19,934
Nah, different shit entirely...

114
00:09:20,017 --> 00:09:22,812
Anyone involved in that
is disappearin' one by one.

115
00:09:22,895 --> 00:09:23,896
Disappearing?

116
00:09:23,980 --> 00:09:26,232
Probably dead somewhere.

117
00:09:26,315 --> 00:09:29,735
Even on the decline, getting
mixed up with 'Saka never ends well.

118
00:09:29,819 --> 00:09:32,029
That whole corp's fuckin' cursed.

119
00:09:34,031 --> 00:09:36,826
You a survivor from the camp?

120
00:09:37,493 --> 00:09:40,913
And you've been doin' this ever since?

121
00:09:41,664 --> 00:09:42,665
All this time?

122
00:10:05,938 --> 00:10:09,567
- D, did you just kill--
- He's not dead.

123
00:10:10,276 --> 00:10:11,444
I'm no killer.

124
00:10:12,612 --> 00:10:14,280
He didn't do it.

125
00:10:21,037 --> 00:10:24,707
Can I... go home?

126
00:10:24,790 --> 00:10:25,916
What?

127
00:10:38,429 --> 00:10:44,310
This new implant is syncing well
with your daughter so far.

128
00:10:44,894 --> 00:10:47,938
Frankly, removing it
may do more harm than good.

129
00:10:48,022 --> 00:10:50,441
But is it really safe?

130
00:10:50,524 --> 00:10:54,904
She’s already chromed up head to toe.
I’m worried she’s going to lose her mind...

131
00:10:54,987 --> 00:10:57,323
You mean, in terms of cyberpsychosis?

132
00:10:57,406 --> 00:10:58,407
Yes.

133
00:10:58,491 --> 00:11:03,579
Given her amount of implants, it wouldn’t
be a surprise if symptoms started showing.

134
00:11:03,663 --> 00:11:06,916
But so far, we haven't seen any signs.

135
00:11:06,999 --> 00:11:10,628
This is an exceptionally rare case...
but she remains stable.

136
00:11:11,462 --> 00:11:13,089
I see no need for concern.

137
00:11:14,507 --> 00:11:16,717
Now, about her treatment plan...

138
00:11:18,469 --> 00:11:20,846
I'll have to return to the office.

139
00:11:21,639 --> 00:11:22,640
I know.

140
00:11:23,140 --> 00:11:26,185
She's going to be fine. Trust the doctor.

141
00:11:26,268 --> 00:11:28,979
But if she gets any more implants...

142
00:11:29,063 --> 00:11:32,691
I understand.
That's why we brought her in.

143
00:11:32,775 --> 00:11:35,069
- She'll be fine for now...
- For now?!

144
00:11:35,152 --> 00:11:37,238
We gotta cut her off for good!

145
00:11:37,321 --> 00:11:38,406
How, exactly?

146
00:11:39,115 --> 00:11:44,036
You understand what makes her
want to rely on implants, don't you?

147
00:11:44,995 --> 00:11:46,831
You think this is my fault...

148
00:11:46,914 --> 00:11:47,998
Not at all.

149
00:11:48,833 --> 00:11:51,377
If there's any blame to bear,
then it falls to us both.

150
00:11:52,086 --> 00:11:54,088
But this isn't anyone's fault.

151
00:11:54,171 --> 00:11:56,298
Not yours, not Talia's.

152
00:11:57,842 --> 00:12:02,888
Think carefully.
Let's decide what the best option is.

153
00:12:03,889 --> 00:12:05,516
You're right. I'm sorry.

154
00:12:05,599 --> 00:12:06,600
Don’t be.

155
00:12:07,143 --> 00:12:09,603
I had hoped to see Talia,
but I should get going.

156
00:12:10,354 --> 00:12:12,356
Work won’t stop calling me.

157
00:12:13,399 --> 00:12:14,400
I'm here.

158
00:12:15,401 --> 00:12:16,777
Yeah... Nothing's wrong...

159
00:12:16,861 --> 00:12:18,070
It's a separate matter.

160
00:12:18,821 --> 00:12:20,281
About that...

161
00:12:22,575 --> 00:12:25,536
Avida, what's the matter?
Where's your husband?

162
00:12:25,619 --> 00:12:27,079
He left.

163
00:12:27,580 --> 00:12:29,039
Did somethin' happen?

164
00:12:29,790 --> 00:12:31,167
Nothin'...

165
00:12:32,334 --> 00:12:33,794
I wonder if Talia's awake.

166
00:12:37,214 --> 00:12:40,634
Might still be asleep, but...
maybe you could at least see her.

167
00:12:41,969 --> 00:12:44,555
Talia! What are you doing?!

168
00:12:44,638 --> 00:12:47,641
Where are your clothes?!
Look what you've done to your gown...

169
00:12:47,725 --> 00:12:51,520
Talia! Why do you always...

170
00:12:51,604 --> 00:12:52,605
Who's he?

171
00:12:55,191 --> 00:12:58,110
What, first time seein' chrome like this?

172
00:12:58,611 --> 00:12:59,612
No, just...

173
00:13:00,237 --> 00:13:01,697
Uh-huh.

174
00:13:03,991 --> 00:13:06,660
Was you who called 'em in.
Wasn't it, Mom?

175
00:13:06,744 --> 00:13:08,287
Them?

176
00:13:08,370 --> 00:13:10,122
Kang Tao's troops.

177
00:13:10,998 --> 00:13:12,124
Unbelievable.

178
00:13:12,208 --> 00:13:14,460
That was because you...

179
00:13:15,127 --> 00:13:17,546
- What'd the doc say?
- What?

180
00:13:17,630 --> 00:13:19,465
Am I goin' cyberpsycho?

181
00:13:19,548 --> 00:13:22,009
He said you're stable for now.

182
00:13:23,219 --> 00:13:24,386
Then I'm outta here.

183
00:13:24,470 --> 00:13:26,889
Already? I'll go with you...

184
00:13:27,681 --> 00:13:29,141
I'm not going home.

185
00:13:29,225 --> 00:13:30,309
Avida!

186
00:13:31,977 --> 00:13:33,646
- Ouch...
- Shit!

187
00:13:37,775 --> 00:13:38,901
See ya.

188
00:13:40,194 --> 00:13:41,237
Talia!

189
00:13:51,163 --> 00:13:52,373
Talia!

190
00:13:55,626 --> 00:13:57,545
Avida, you stay here.

191
00:14:06,929 --> 00:14:08,097
Hey.

192
00:14:09,056 --> 00:14:12,059
Sorry, but I know this area well.

193
00:14:12,142 --> 00:14:13,143
Who're you again?

194
00:14:13,727 --> 00:14:16,480
I'm an... old friend of your mom's.

195
00:14:16,564 --> 00:14:17,856
So you're nobody.

196
00:14:18,482 --> 00:14:20,276
Can we talk for a bit?

197
00:14:23,070 --> 00:14:24,238
Wait.

198
00:14:26,323 --> 00:14:28,617
I'll tell you how to disable the GPS.

199
00:14:29,201 --> 00:14:31,996
Take it that's what
you were searchin' for earlier?

200
00:14:32,872 --> 00:14:34,999
So they can't track down your whereabouts...

201
00:14:35,499 --> 00:14:37,376
- Am I right?
- You can do that?

202
00:14:38,127 --> 00:14:40,963
Kang Tao would've chipped it
along the inner thigh.

203
00:14:41,797 --> 00:14:44,049
If I disable it, will you hear me out?

204
00:14:45,467 --> 00:14:47,428
Touch me, I flatline you.

205
00:14:47,511 --> 00:14:49,555
No problem. Won't have to.

206
00:14:53,726 --> 00:14:55,394
You're an edgerunner?

207
00:14:56,145 --> 00:14:57,146
Suppose so.

208
00:14:58,147 --> 00:14:59,940
Okay. All done.

209
00:15:00,983 --> 00:15:04,403
Overwrote the ID.
They can't track you anymore.

210
00:15:06,196 --> 00:15:08,782
So, about what I wanted to say...

211
00:15:12,661 --> 00:15:14,580
We're about the same.

212
00:15:15,456 --> 00:15:16,582
What do you mean?

213
00:15:16,665 --> 00:15:17,833
Our height.

214
00:15:23,589 --> 00:15:25,591
Fuck! Talia!

215
00:15:51,450 --> 00:15:53,035
I miss my camera...

216
00:15:53,577 --> 00:15:55,204
- What's that?
- Huh?

217
00:15:55,287 --> 00:15:56,747
That’s a camera, isn’t it?

218
00:15:56,830 --> 00:15:58,165
This is my backup camera.

219
00:15:58,248 --> 00:15:59,792
What's the difference?

220
00:15:59,875 --> 00:16:02,962
Oh, you wanna hear about it?
You interested?

221
00:16:03,045 --> 00:16:04,046
No.

222
00:16:05,714 --> 00:16:07,800
Think it's time to call it quits?

223
00:16:07,883 --> 00:16:09,510
Easy for you to say.

224
00:16:09,593 --> 00:16:11,679
You're all outta leads, aren't you?

225
00:16:11,762 --> 00:16:13,389
That's why I'm thinking.

226
00:16:13,472 --> 00:16:15,599
Then let me know
when you come up with somethin'.

227
00:16:15,683 --> 00:16:17,101
You think too!

228
00:16:17,184 --> 00:16:18,352
Me?

229
00:16:18,435 --> 00:16:21,188
Damn right. Ass stays here
till you come up with an idea.

230
00:16:23,023 --> 00:16:26,110
How about we hack into Arasaka
and snoop around for info?

231
00:16:26,193 --> 00:16:28,779
Are you stupid?
Even washed-up, they're still a corp.

232
00:16:28,862 --> 00:16:32,992
Not directly... but what about
a smaller corp they work with?

233
00:16:33,075 --> 00:16:35,369
We could access 'Saka through them.

234
00:16:39,248 --> 00:16:42,626
Shit. The hell is this? Ugh, no good.

235
00:16:43,293 --> 00:16:45,212
There’s no link to begin with!

236
00:16:45,295 --> 00:16:46,922
What's our move now?

237
00:16:47,006 --> 00:16:48,882
- Huh? Me?
- Was your idea.

238
00:16:48,966 --> 00:16:50,759
So it's my fault?

239
00:16:54,096 --> 00:16:58,976
Hey, 'bout what Helio said...
Mentioned some kind of Arasaka chip.

240
00:16:59,059 --> 00:17:00,769
Did you get any info on that?

241
00:17:00,853 --> 00:17:05,107
Sure. Pulled somethin',
just in case... This it?

242
00:17:05,190 --> 00:17:08,444
If you get that chip,
Arasaka might wanna negotiate.

243
00:17:09,903 --> 00:17:11,113
You think so?

244
00:17:11,196 --> 00:17:14,616
I dunno... But what other
options do you have?

245
00:17:15,409 --> 00:17:16,410
None.

246
00:17:16,493 --> 00:17:19,830
Then what've you got to lose?
I say we try it.

247
00:17:21,331 --> 00:17:22,791
Data says it’s around here?

248
00:17:25,210 --> 00:17:26,253
That building?

249
00:17:26,962 --> 00:17:28,047
Yeah.

250
00:17:28,130 --> 00:17:29,131
What's up?

251
00:17:29,214 --> 00:17:32,426
That building not givin' you
the heebie-jeebies?

252
00:17:32,509 --> 00:17:33,635
Heebie-jeebies...?

253
00:17:34,762 --> 00:17:36,513
I can't really tell.

254
00:17:37,723 --> 00:17:38,974
Whatever.

255
00:17:47,649 --> 00:17:48,650
D!

256
00:17:48,734 --> 00:17:51,153
Any luck over there?

257
00:17:53,947 --> 00:17:55,282
D!

258
00:17:55,365 --> 00:17:58,285
I’m not seeing any doors that’ll open.

259
00:17:59,787 --> 00:18:02,498
D? What's the matter?

260
00:18:02,581 --> 00:18:05,334
- Surveillance cams everywhere.
- Where?

261
00:18:05,417 --> 00:18:09,004
Don't waste your time lookin' for 'em.
They're concealed well.

262
00:18:09,088 --> 00:18:10,297
Seriously?

263
00:18:11,590 --> 00:18:13,842
Every other door’s a bust.

264
00:18:13,926 --> 00:18:16,595
This one might open, but...

265
00:18:16,678 --> 00:18:17,846
But?

266
00:18:17,930 --> 00:18:21,225
Counterintrusion on this place
would put most corps to shame.

267
00:18:21,308 --> 00:18:23,811
Except this door... where they left a gap.

268
00:18:23,894 --> 00:18:25,938
Maybe they made it
easier to get in and out?

269
00:18:26,021 --> 00:18:27,397
Normally, it's the other way around.

270
00:18:27,481 --> 00:18:30,234
Which means this is probably a trap.

271
00:18:30,317 --> 00:18:31,652
A trap?

272
00:18:34,029 --> 00:18:35,030
What do we do?

273
00:18:35,739 --> 00:18:36,740
We go in.

274
00:18:36,824 --> 00:18:39,159
What? But it's a trap!

275
00:18:39,243 --> 00:18:41,662
They're daring me to bite.

276
00:18:41,745 --> 00:18:44,164
Fuck it. I'll bite.

277
00:18:48,669 --> 00:18:50,129
- Careful...
- Just watch.

278
00:19:10,774 --> 00:19:12,651
Didn't do it.

279
00:19:31,670 --> 00:19:33,130
Oh, you're awake.

280
00:19:35,132 --> 00:19:36,133
Where am I?

281
00:19:36,216 --> 00:19:37,342
My place.

282
00:19:37,426 --> 00:19:40,804
You passed out, so I had to deal with it.
Couldn’t just leave you there.

283
00:19:40,888 --> 00:19:42,055
- The cab--
- Where is she!?

284
00:19:42,139 --> 00:19:44,141
What do you mean? "She", who?

285
00:19:44,641 --> 00:19:46,810
- You're payin' for that cab--
- Dammit!

286
00:19:46,894 --> 00:19:48,353
That bitch...

287
00:19:53,275 --> 00:19:54,484
Got up too fast.

288
00:19:54,568 --> 00:19:56,695
Dropped me in a second.

289
00:19:56,778 --> 00:19:58,739
Don’t even know how it happened.

290
00:20:02,826 --> 00:20:03,952
What are you gonna do?

291
00:20:04,536 --> 00:20:07,164
Revenge...

292
00:20:07,915 --> 00:20:09,166
You can't even stand.

293
00:20:11,835 --> 00:20:13,253
Morning already?

294
00:20:13,337 --> 00:20:15,005
- It's almost night.
- What?!

295
00:20:15,088 --> 00:20:16,965
- You slept half the day.
- The fuck?!

296
00:20:17,049 --> 00:20:19,218
Roman! Did your friend wake up?

297
00:20:19,301 --> 00:20:20,302
Yeah, Dad!

298
00:20:20,385 --> 00:20:22,679
- Can you run an errand for me?
- Okay.

299
00:20:22,763 --> 00:20:26,183
I’ll goin' out, D.
You can get revenge tomorrow.

300
00:20:26,266 --> 00:20:29,436
Oh, and don't forget
to pay me back for the cab!

301
00:20:42,282 --> 00:20:46,078
Hey! Uh, what was it... 'Ganic boy!

302
00:20:46,161 --> 00:20:47,663
No, wait, who are you?

303
00:20:49,539 --> 00:20:51,833
Hey! Remember me?

304
00:20:51,917 --> 00:20:53,210
Huh?

305
00:20:54,294 --> 00:20:56,338
- Huh?!
- No?

306
00:20:56,421 --> 00:20:59,007
- Well, about your recording...
- I'm kinda busy shopping...

307
00:20:59,091 --> 00:21:01,343
- Sorry!
- Why the big rush?

308
00:21:01,426 --> 00:21:03,637
Um, I'm shopping...

309
00:21:03,720 --> 00:21:04,888
You look done to me.

310
00:21:05,764 --> 00:21:06,890
I'm sorry.

311
00:21:06,974 --> 00:21:09,017
What's with the apology?

312
00:21:09,101 --> 00:21:11,186
You're not mad at me?

313
00:21:11,270 --> 00:21:12,980
You're sure working me up to it.

314
00:21:13,855 --> 00:21:15,565
Kidding. Here ya go.

315
00:21:15,649 --> 00:21:17,859
- My camera...
- Returning it.

316
00:21:17,943 --> 00:21:20,112
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

317
00:21:20,195 --> 00:21:22,698
Hey, it was a great reel.

318
00:21:22,781 --> 00:21:23,782
Huh?

319
00:21:23,865 --> 00:21:26,868
The vid of me! Watched it a few times.

320
00:21:27,536 --> 00:21:29,746
Well, this is a good camera.

321
00:21:32,708 --> 00:21:34,293
Uh... W-What--

322
00:21:34,376 --> 00:21:37,879
Good camera or not,
an ordinary person couldn't scroll that.

323
00:21:38,547 --> 00:21:40,299
Y-You think so?

324
00:21:40,382 --> 00:21:41,383
You've got talent.

325
00:21:43,218 --> 00:21:44,886
Um... well...

326
00:21:44,970 --> 00:21:47,639
Thanks, I guess.

327
00:21:48,223 --> 00:21:49,683
Say, scroll me again?

328
00:21:50,309 --> 00:21:51,643
What?

329
00:21:51,727 --> 00:21:52,894
You won't?

330
00:21:52,978 --> 00:21:56,606
- S-sure.
- Great!

331
00:21:56,690 --> 00:21:57,733
It's a promise!

332
00:21:57,816 --> 00:21:59,568
Oh, can I get your contact info?

333
00:21:59,651 --> 00:22:01,153
Yeah, sure.

334
00:22:01,778 --> 00:22:04,281
Let's see... Roman?

335
00:22:05,115 --> 00:22:06,283
I'm Talia.

336
00:22:06,366 --> 00:22:08,201
- Nice to meet ya.
- You too...

337
00:22:08,285 --> 00:22:10,787
So come by tomorrow and scroll my surgery.

338
00:22:11,997 --> 00:22:13,165
Surgery?

339
00:22:15,208 --> 00:22:16,543
Sorry, gotta go.

340
00:22:16,626 --> 00:22:18,545
- I'll buzz ya later.
- Hey, wait...

341
00:22:18,628 --> 00:22:20,464
Bye now! Lookin' forward to tomorrow!

342
00:22:20,547 --> 00:22:21,923
Hey! Tomorrow?!

343
00:22:25,010 --> 00:22:26,511
Whoa... So cool.

344
00:22:29,765 --> 00:22:31,141
Agh... dead battery...

345
00:23:07,886 --> 00:23:09,262
Whatcha doin'?

346
00:23:09,346 --> 00:23:11,890
Upping my ICE, just in case.

347
00:23:12,474 --> 00:23:13,850
Still goin' today?

348
00:23:13,934 --> 00:23:16,019
Yup. Gonna wrap this up, then we go.

349
00:23:16,103 --> 00:23:17,896
Uh, about me...

350
00:23:17,979 --> 00:23:18,980
You're coming.

351
00:23:19,523 --> 00:23:20,857
Right...

352
00:23:45,465 --> 00:23:47,968
Talia, ready to get started?

353
00:23:48,468 --> 00:23:49,594
'Kay.

354
00:24:03,441 --> 00:24:05,694
Hey! Back off!

355
00:24:05,777 --> 00:24:07,362
What's goin' on?

356
00:24:07,445 --> 00:24:09,364
Found this guy creepin' outside.

357
00:24:10,448 --> 00:24:11,491
Dammit!

358
00:24:14,953 --> 00:24:16,371
Who is he?

359
00:24:16,454 --> 00:24:17,914
Fuck if I know.

360
00:25:49,923 --> 00:25:54,928
Subtitle translation by:
CD PROJEKT RED & Megumi Hunter
